Subject: [PATCH] perf(v2): skip redundant BIP30 disk lookups on V2
 height-committed coinbases and skip V2 input identity re-encoding

Skip redundant ConnectBlock BIP30 disk lookups when V2 coinbases commit
(hashPrevBlock, nHeight) in vin[0] and reuse cached txid/txhash in CScriptCheck.

